;; dougaka (動画家) — the actor manifest.
;;
;; ## Why this file did not exist until 2026-09-01
;;
;; It was not an oversight with no consequence. `scripts/itonami-actor-pnl.cljs`
;; folds ADR-2608291009 決定 5 (bot の損益) over the population that holds an
;; actor.edn, and dougaka is **the fleet's largest consumer of metered credits**
;; — 1,858 of the 2,484 credits any account has ever spent. Without a manifest
;; it was outside that population entirely, so the biggest cost in the ledger
;; was not merely unattributed: it could not be attributed, by construction.
;;
;; ## :actor/murakumo-account is the cost-side join
;;
;; `:actor/x402-seller` says where revenue would arrive. This says where spend
;; leaves from, and it is the same kind of declaration for the same reason: the
;; ledger names accounts, this repo has a name, and nothing joins them unless
;; somebody writes it down. Measured before and after
;; (scripts/itonami-actor-pnl.cljs): `KUMO BURN 0 attributed / 2484
;; unattributed` → `1858 attributed / 626 unattributed`.
;;
;; The account name is `dougaka`, a bare ledger account rather than a did:key.
;; That is what the run feed actually carries for this spender, and writing the
;; did it *ought* to be would produce a join that matches nothing.

{:actor/id              "dougaka"
 :handle                "dougaka.aozora.app"
 :actor/murakumo-account "dougaka"

 ;; Revenue-side join, declared and deliberately not yet true: no catalog entry
 ;; names this seller. `pricing.edn` is denominated on base-sepolia precisely so
 ;; that this line cannot start earning real value by accident.
 :actor/x402-seller     "dougaka"

 :actor/kind            :production
 :actor/produces        {:format "vertical short (720x1280)"
                         :duration-seconds [45 90]}
 :actor/governor        "DougakaGovernor"
 :actor/engine          "cloud-itonami/ai-gftd-dougaka — dougaka.pipeline"
 :actor/publishes-to    "app-aozora /videos (app.aozora.embed.video, ADR-2607071000)"
 :actor/unit-economics  "90-docs/system-dynamics/dougaka-unit-economics.cljs (com-junkawasaki/root)"}
